'''Nord Knucklechains''' are [[Deep North]]-tier [[Fists]].

* The primary attack is a 2-hit combo with 2x damage at the second hit.
* The secondary attack is a kick which does additional knockback and 6x [[staggering]].
* They deal 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

They cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Knucklechains]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Knucklechains''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrading ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, Nord Knucklechains can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Knucklechains}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Knucklechains}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

Upgraded Nord Knucklechains will '''NOT''' keep their upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

